{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-h2o-bond-angle-shift","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proof","doco:Section"],"label":"prf:h2o-bond-angle-shift","kind":"proof","title":"Proof of h2o bond angle shift","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-h2o-bond-angle-shift"],"text":"h2o-bond-angle-shift-proof.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prf:h2o-bond-angle-shift\"></a><p>Writing <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b = 2as</code>, the energy minus its value at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\theta_0 - s</code> is the perfect square <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a\\bigl(\\theta - (\\theta_0 - s)\\bigr)^2 \\ge 0</code>, so <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\theta_0 - s = \\theta_0 - b/(2a)</code> is the global minimiser. <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\qquad\\blacksquare</code></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-bond-angle-shift-proof.md","heading":"Proof","page":"b/prf-h2o-bond-angle-shift","qa":{"counts":{"pass":56,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":58},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
